{
  "schema_version": 2,
  "diagram_type": "workflow",
  "meta": {
    "title": "FA1 Forward:外层 Q 块 × 内层 K/V 块的双层 tiling",
    "subtitle": "Q 块只读一次;每个 K/V 块载入 SRAM 后,分数、softmax、累加全部在片上完成,不写任何 N×N 矩阵",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "output": "diagrams/fa-fa1-tiling.workflow.html",
    "viewBox": [
      1100,
      700
    ]
  },
  "lanes": [
    {
      "id": "ln_outer",
      "label": "外层:遍历 Q 块(i)"
    },
    {
      "id": "ln_inner",
      "label": "内层:遍历 K/V 块(j)"
    },
    {
      "id": "ln_write",
      "label": "收尾"
    }
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "n_init",
      "lane": "ln_outer",
      "col": 0,
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "定块大小 Br,Bc",
      "sublabel": "Bc≈M/(4d):SRAM 预算",
      "icon": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_qi",
      "lane": "ln_outer",
      "col": 1,
      "type": "database",
      "label": "载入 Q 块 Qi",
      "sublabel": "读一次,驻留 SRAM",
      "icon": "database"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_state",
      "lane": "ln_outer",
      "col": 2,
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "初始化 Oi/mi/li",
      "sublabel": "O=0,m=-inf,l=0",
      "icon": "active",
      "width": 124
    },
    {
      "id": "n_kv",
      "lane": "ln_inner",
      "col": 3,
      "type": "database",
      "label": "载入 Kj,Vj",
      "sublabel": "每轮一块,片上复用",
      "icon": "database",
      "width": 124
    },
    {
      "id": "n_sij",
      "lane": "ln_inner",
      "col": 4,
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "Sij=Qi@Kjᵀ·s",
      "sublabel": "[Br,Bc] 只存 SRAM",
      "width": 124
    },
    {
      "id": "n_online",
      "lane": "ln_inner",
      "col": 5,
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "online softmax",
      "sublabel": "rescale m、l、Oi 后累加",
      "icon": "active",
      "width": 124
    },
    {
      "id": "n_norm",
      "lane": "ln_write",
      "col": 5,
      "type": "database",
      "label": "Oi=Oi/li 写回",
      "sublabel": "整行一次除法,一次写出",
      "icon": "success",
      "width": 124
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "from": "n_init",
      "to": "n_qi",
      "label": "Br = min(⌈M/4d⌉, d)",
      "role": "main"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2",
      "from": "n_qi",
      "to": "n_state",
      "label": "Qi 就绪",
      "role": "main"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3",
      "from": "n_state",
      "to": "n_kv",
      "label": "进入内层循环",
      "role": "main"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4",
      "from": "n_kv",
      "to": "n_sij",
      "label": "Kj、Vj 就绪",
      "role": "main"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5",
      "from": "n_sij",
      "to": "n_online",
      "label": "分数块不出 SRAM",
      "role": "main"
    },
    {
      "id": "e6",
      "from": "n_online",
      "to": "n_kv",
      "label": "j+1:下一 K/V 块",
      "role": "branch",
      "variant": "dashed"
    },
    {
      "id": "e7",
      "from": "n_online",
      "to": "n_norm",
      "label": "内层结束",
      "role": "main"
    }
  ],
  "mainPath": [
    "n_init",
    "n_qi",
    "n_state",
    "n_kv",
    "n_sij",
    "n_online",
    "n_norm"
  ],
  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "块大小从哪来",
      "items": [
        "SRAM 需同时装 Q、K、V、O 四块(各 Bc·d)+ S 块(Bc²)",
        "4·Bc·d + Bc² ≈ M → Bc ≈ M/(4d)",
        "A100 实数参考:d=64 时 ≈128,d=128 时 ≈64"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "每一步的读写位置",
      "items": [
        "Q 块:读一次,整个内层循环复用",
        "K/V 块:每轮读一次,SRAM 内被 Q 块所有行复用",
        "S、P:只在 SRAM,从不写 HBM",
        "输出 Oi:每个 Q 块最终只写一次"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "注意(读论文时)",
      "items": [
        "论文 Algorithm 1 外层是 K/V、内层是 Q(与本图相反)",
        "本图是逻辑等价的简化变体,更贴合\"每行输出遇到的 KV 序列\"",
        "FA2 才把循环翻成外层 Q、内层 K/V"
      ]
    }
  ]
}